                                                                <rect key="frame" x="10" y="114.33333333333334" width="373" height="197.00000000000003"/>
                                                                <string key="text">At SyriaBooking.sy, we’re on a mission to transform how people explore and experience Syria — by making travel simpler, smarter, and more accessible for everyone. We’re building the country’s go-to platform for hotel bookings, and we’re looking for passionate individuals to grow with us.

Whether you’re a tech expert, customer service champion, creative storyteller, or business strategist — if you believe in innovation, integrity, and impact, you’ll feel at home here.</string>
